'''Jessica Miller''' (Japanese: '''ジェシカ・ミラー''' ''Jessica Miller'') is a friend of [[Rachel Myers]] and a former research assistant for [[Emma Myers]] at the [[Pokémon Unity Lab]] in the game [[Detective Pikachu Returns]].

==In the games==
===[[Detective Pikachu Returns]]===
[[File:Unity Lab founding.jpg|thumb|200px|Photo of Jessica at the Pokémon Unity Lab|left]] 
[[Tim Goodman|Tim]] and {{OBP|Detective Pikachu|character}} first encounter Jessica with Rachel at the [[Hi-Hat Café]] while investigating the theft of the [[Aurora Drop]]. She informs them that she works at a pizzeria at [[Bamboo Borough]] and invites them over if they were ever within the area. 

Later, while detained at the [[Ryme City Police Station]], Pikachu discovers a photo in [[Will Butler]]'s office showing Jessica as [[Unitas]]'s next potential target. Worried, Tim, Rachel and Pikachu head to Bamboo Borough to check in on Jessica. When they arrive, they join Jessica on a trip into the Bamboo Forest to acquire charcoal for the pizzeria. However, while in the forest, Rachel and Jessica are attacked by a member of Unitas controlling a {{p|Golem}}. Although Tim and Pikachu successfully defeat the Golem and free it from the [[Control Cube]], the mysterious man escapes with Jessica's thumbdrive containing research from Rachel's mother, Emma. As her research assistant at the time, Jessica had been given this for safe-keeping out of fear it could be used to harm people and Pokémon. The research suggests a way that it would be possible for a person and Pokémon's consciousness to be combined.
